  "prefLabel": "Ath 501.01 Obligation to Comply with Laws",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ath 501.01 Obligation to Comply with Laws. Licensees shall comply with RSA 326-G and its implementing rules Ath 100 through Ath 500, RSA 328-F, and all other laws as they are applicable to them.\n\nSource. #8407, eff 8-10-05; ss by #9100, eff 3-1-08; ss by #10869, eff 6-27-15; ss by #14116, eff 1-20-25",
